Bundled programs
----------------
The editor's packages include tools/luau-lsp (tools/luau-lsp.exe on
Windows): luau-lsp, the Luau language server by JohnnyMorganz
(https://github.com/JohnnyMorganz/luau-lsp), unmodified, so script tabs can
type-check. It is licensed under the MIT License; its license is in
tools/luau-lsp-LICENSE.txt beside it. Exported games don't include it.

